WEBVTT

00:05:26.822 --> 00:05:33.162
For example, if I’m using my smart
assistant, and I’m listening to music,

00:05:33.204 --> 00:05:35.498
and then I say, "Change."

00:05:36.082 --> 00:05:37.208
VA: Hi, Karen.

00:05:37.249 --> 00:05:40.044
Do you want to change
the temperature of the room?

00:05:40.044 --> 00:05:42.546
KLT: Well, clearly
this is not working yet,

00:05:42.588 --> 00:05:43.964
but in the future,

00:05:44.006 --> 00:05:47.301
it will understand that I'm talking
about changing the track,

00:05:47.301 --> 00:05:49.470
not changing the temperature of the room.

00:05:50.596 --> 00:05:54.767
It will also understand
our long and complex requests.

00:05:54.809 --> 00:05:57.103
You know, when we start saying something

00:05:57.103 --> 00:05:59.855
and then we change our mind mid-sentence.